{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-js","path":"/pensieve/wordpress-publish-error/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<h2>Problem</h2>\n<p>Recently while working on a WordPress project with <a href=\"https://github.com/Upstatement/ups-dock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Ups Dock</a>, I encountered a weird error where I wasn't able to update or publish a simple post in my local WP admin.</p>\n<p>It looked something like this:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 700px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 32.57142857142857%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/df5b1/draft-fail.avif 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/834e9/draft-fail.avif 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/3bcc4/draft-fail.avif 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/f9a64/draft-fail.avif 1050w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/cbb88/draft-fail.avif 1400w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/09f00/draft-fail.avif 2234w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/9cece/draft-fail.webp 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/adf5f/draft-fail.webp 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/fa73e/draft-fail.webp 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/7e3cb/draft-fail.webp 1050w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/aa619/draft-fail.webp 1400w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/c6d44/draft-fail.webp 2234w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/1aaec/draft-fail.png 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/98287/draft-fail.png 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/39600/draft-fail.png 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/57cd1/draft-fail.png 1050w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/4af54/draft-fail.png 1400w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/8e621/draft-fail.png 2234w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/9a92c868095081fef605169d5c41eaee/39600/draft-fail.png\"\n            alt=\"Draft fail\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Sometimes the error message would be slightly more helpful: <code class=\"language-text\">Publishing failed. Error message: The response is not a valid JSON response.</code></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 700px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 12%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAACCAIAAADXZGvcAAAACXBIWXMAAAsTAAALEwEAmpwYAAAAZElEQVR42h2KCQ6DMBAD+f/fGpEseyQUcSUQaFG/gIs0sqyxm6vvd5ZDDXxifEiH2Tcl9POP4QNgTosbC3xV+72HBr+pbRcf1hAKMbbS8fByG3MVxTR7j76LrESZuhyQNDpXVW+6sWcF36nXMQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/df5b1/publish-error.avif 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/834e9/publish-error.avif 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/3bcc4/publish-error.avif 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/41ca6/publish-error.avif 956w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/9cece/publish-error.webp 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/adf5f/publish-error.webp 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/fa73e/publish-error.webp 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/98c77/publish-error.webp 956w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/1aaec/publish-error.png 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/98287/publish-error.png 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/39600/publish-error.png 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/04410/publish-error.png 956w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/ac418cb7402b96be332b88c4505db1b1/39600/publish-error.png\"\n            alt=\"Publish error\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n    </span></p>\n<p>And if I popped open the console, I saw these errors:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 700px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 20.571428571428573%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/df5b1/console-errors.avif 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/834e9/console-errors.avif 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/3bcc4/console-errors.avif 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/f9a64/console-errors.avif 1050w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/fc39c/console-errors.avif 1185w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/9cece/console-errors.webp 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/adf5f/console-errors.webp 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/fa73e/console-errors.webp 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/7e3cb/console-errors.webp 1050w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/30169/console-errors.webp 1185w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/1aaec/console-errors.png 175w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/98287/console-errors.png 350w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/39600/console-errors.png 700w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/57cd1/console-errors.png 1050w,\n/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/fb77c/console-errors.png 1185w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/manideep-port/manideep-port/static/d342131a17d748d605395cbdcc072a7f/39600/console-errors.png\"\n            alt=\"Console errors\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n    </span></p>\n<h2>Solution</h2>\n<p>Since the error message had to do with a JSON response, I initially thought it was a Gutenberg or ACF issue. But it turned out this was happening because I was on the https WP admin (i.e. <a href=\"https://project.ups.dock/wp-admin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://project.ups.dock/wp-admin</a>), not the unsecure WP admin (<a href=\"http://project.ups.dock/wp-admin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">http://project.ups.dock/wp-admin</a>).</p>\n<p>It was a CORS error!! I was trying to modify a non-https domain from a https domain. Switching to a non-https WP admin allowed me to publish posts with no problem.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"WordPress Publishing Error","description":"Trying to create a simple post in WordPress","date":"2019-12-03T00:00:00.000Z","slug":"/pensieve/wordpress-publish-error","tags":["WordPress"]}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/pensieve/wordpress-publish-error"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1994492073","2009693873","3825832676","844690869"],"slicesMap":{}}